turns.replyText:
Honestly, the cheaper Matelas Hybride is fine for most people and is the better value. It already gives you 25 cm of height, 7 comfort layers, pocket springs, breathable construction and a semi-firm feel.

The Hybride Premium is worth the extra €120 at the current starting prices (€289.90 vs €409.90) only if you specifically want:

more cushioning: 8 cm of foam above the springs instead of 5 cm;
a thicker 27 cm construction;
8 comfort layers instead of 7;
a reversible feel, from more supportive to softer.

So my honest recommendation for your situation is the Matelas Hybride. Choose the Premium if you share the bed, are sensitive to comfort differences, or know you want the option to change the feel. Both come with 100 nights to try them at home.
